 "docs": {
  "en": {
   "title": "Pyrenees: is the snow above or below normal? (4 November)",
   "description": "We compared today's snow at 4 resorts in the Pyrenees with the same date in each of the past 46 winters. 1 of them are clearly above normal.",
   "lede": "We compared today's snow at 4 resorts in the Pyrenees with the same date in each of the past 46 winters. 1 of them are clearly above normal.",
   "sections": [
    {
     "h": "Is it a good start?",
     "p": [
      "At 2,072 m on Cauterets Cirque du Lys, today's 0 cm is close to normal for the date: deeper than in 21 of the past 46 winters (usual: 1 cm).",
      "At 2,060 m on Aramón Cerler, today's 0 cm is close to normal for the date: deeper than in 22 of the past 46 winters (usual: 0 cm).",
      "This is a good start at Rasos de Peguera. At 1,931 m, our model has 10 cm today, deeper than on this date in 46 of the past 46 winters (usual: 0 cm).",
      "At 1,900 m on Espot, today's 1 cm is close to normal for the date: deeper than in 30 of the past 46 winters (usual: 0 cm)."
     ]
    },
    {
     "h": "Rain up to the top?",
     "p": [
      "On Saturday 7 November the freezing level climbs to about 2,810 m, above the top of the lifts at 2,420 m: rain can fall even at the top.",
      "Rain on fresh snow makes it heavy and, after a cold night, icy: the days after are better for groomed runs than for powder.",
      "At about 2,072 m, Cauterets Cirque du Lys has 0 cm today; a normal 4 November has 1 cm there.",
      "That is more than in 21 of the 46 past winters on this date.",
      "In past winters the best snow at Cauterets Cirque du Lys usually came early February / mid-February.",
      "Day by day at Cauterets Cirque du Lys: Thursday 5 November 1 cm; Saturday 7 November 2 cm.",
      "Height by height at Cauterets Cirque du Lys: 1,725 m 0 cm on the ground, 0 cm more in the next 7 days; 2,072 m 0 cm on the ground, 0 cm more in the next 7 days; 2,420 m 0 cm on the ground, 0 cm more in the next 7 days."
     ]
    },
    {
     "h": "Today's snow",
     "p": [
      "Of these resorts, Cauterets Cirque du Lys has the most snow on its upper slopes today, about 25 cm; then come Aramón Cerler 18 cm and Rasos de Peguera 13 cm.",
      "38 of 53 resorts in the Pyrenees have snow on their upper slopes today, and our model counts 1,330 km² of snow-covered ground.",
      "Keep in mind: resort values come from our snow model and describe an area, while stations measure one point."
     ]
    },
    {
     "h": "What is coming next",
     "p": [
      "More snow is on the way: by 7 November our forecast gives 5 cm at Aramón Cerler, 3 cm at Cauterets Cirque du Lys and 2 cm at Rasos de Peguera.",
      "Forecasts a few days ahead can change: look at the map again the day before you travel."
     ]
    }
   ],
   "advice": [
    "Look for snow high up and on north-facing slopes: they keep it longest, while south-facing slopes lose it first in the sun.",
    "Snow on the map does not mean a resort is open: check lifts and opening dates on the resort's website.",
    "Early-season snow is thin. Stay on open, groomed pistes: rocks and grass can hide just under the surface.",
    "Get a powder alert in the SnowScope app to know when Cauterets Cirque du Lys gets fresh snow."
   ],
   "captions": {
    "map": "Snow depth in the Pyrenees on 4 November 2026 (SnowScope snow model): Cauterets Cirque du Lys, Aramón Cerler, Rasos de Peguera, Espot.",
    "season_chart": "This winter at Cauterets Cirque du Lys (line) against the usual range of past winters (band) and their middle (dashed).",
    "photo": "Cauterets Cirque du Lys"
   }
  },
  "fr": {
   "title": "Pyrénées : la neige au-dessus ou en dessous de la normale ? (4 novembre)",
   "description": "Nous avons comparé la neige du jour dans 4 stations dans les Pyrénées avec la même date lors de chacun des 46 hivers passés. 1 sont nettement …",
   "lede": "Nous avons comparé la neige du jour dans 4 stations dans les Pyrénées avec la même date lors de chacun des 46 hivers passés. 1 sont nettement au-dessus de la normale.",
   "sections": [
    {
     "h": "Comparé aux hivers passés",
     "p": [
      "À 2 072 m à Cauterets Cirque du Lys, les 0 cm d'aujourd'hui sont proches de la normale pour la date : plus que lors de 21 des 46 hivers passés (habituel : 1 cm).",
